cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EMOL: Molecular orbital calculation program for educational or prototyping environment"
abstract: "A prototype molecular orbital program in Ruby with C extensions (libcint-based integrals, RHF/UHF, integral transformation, MP2, DRT-based CI, super-CI CASSCF). The CSF-based Hamiltonian matrix element expressions later developed into the hexpr library were first implemented and tested in EMOL."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
